X:3
T:Dr. Fausters Tumblers. PFD3.003
B:Playford, Dancing Master Vol 3, 2nd Ed, c1726
Z:village music project, Steve Mansfield 2015
M:C|
L:1/4
W:Longways for as many as will
W:Note: Each Strain twice
W:The first Man Sets to the second Woman and turns single, and then
W:Back to Back with her .| The second man and the first Woman do the same :|
W:Then the first and second Man fall back to the Wall, and the two Woman
W:the same at the same time, and change into their Partners Places, then
W:all four fall back and change into their own Places |.
W:Then cast off, and go the whole Figure with the third Couple,
W:and turn your Partner into her proper Place |:
